  "steps": [
    "Put the drained chickpeas in a mixing bowl and lightly crush a few with the back of a spoon so the dressing clings, leaving most chickpeas whole.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes, finely diced red onion and chopped coriander to the bowl.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lime juice, olive oil, cumin, ground coriander, turmeric, chilli powder, salt and black pepper until well combined.",
    "Pour the spiced lime dressing over the chickpea mixture and toss thoroughly until everything is evenly coated.",
    "Taste and adjust with a little more salt or lime juice if needed. Let the salad sit for 5 minutes before serving so the onion softens slightly and the flavours mingle."
  ],
